Collinsizer was developed with AI assistance, incorporating custom AI-assisted Mini Limiter and Talkback scripts.

Offline checks cover macro endpoints, monotonicity, noon-pointer calculations, reset defaults, panel-content guards, knob spacing, code delimiters, slider IDs, and FFT memory boundaries.

